{
  "rc": {
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "streak": "连续",
        "days": "天",
        "recent": "近 30 天",
        "best": "最长连续",
        "total": "总计",
        "avg": "平均间隔",
        "doneToday": "今天已达标",
        "todayIs": "今天",
        "never": "还没有记录",
        "pickItem": "选择事项",
        "masked": "已隐藏",
        "uD": "天",
        "uT": "次",
        "nbsp": " "
      },
      "en-US": {
        "streak": "Streak",
        "days": "d",
        "recent": "Last 30 days",
        "best": "Best streak",
        "total": "Total",
        "avg": "Avg gap",
        "doneToday": "Goal met",
        "todayIs": "Today",
        "never": "No entries yet",
        "pickItem": "Pick a habit",
        "masked": "Hidden",
        "uD": "days",
        "uT": "times",
        "nbsp": " "
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#F9FCFB\\,#EEF7F3)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#161B1D\\,#182221)@90"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色点(card-design-system §2):5pt 圆点 / 卡名左侧 / 间距 9pt / 每张卡恰好一次。⚠️ 色值恒 #2E9E6B|#45C793,**不跟事项的调色板走** —— 这颗点答的是「这是 checkin 的卡」,不是「这件事是紫色的」;跟着 pal 变会让同一个包在盘上看着像六个源。⚠️ y 引用顶层的 nm2(不带图标那份名字,带图标时 hide 但照样布局,与 nm1 同 y 同字号):锚点不能落进 op:if 分支,否则另一档整卡算不出来(2026-10-03 第一行统一)。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{nm2.y}+({nm2.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#2E9E6B|#45C793",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "_note": "卡名行最右那一格恒有内容(card-design-system §3 + §5):常态渲 MM-DD 日期锚(零网络包,锚答的是「这一屏说的是哪天」);打码态改渲状态标记 —— 打码 ≠ 空态,空态是 `--`/空槽加事实陈述,打码是主动语态的一句状态,而那一刻这张卡上没有任何随时间变的可见量、锚零信息量。⚠️ 与网格下方那对坐标轴刻度**刻意重复右端那个日期**:轴读作刻度、右上角读作时间戳,两者在读者那里不是同一件事,而少了右上角这一格,这张卡在一屏 20 张卡里就是唯一空着右上角的那张。",
        "id": "mk",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-94pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "80pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),${@i18n.masked},findNotEmpty::(${atLbl},--))]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hicon},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "ic",
            "type": "img",
            "x": "23pt",
            "y": "10pt",
            "w": "16pt",
            "h": "16pt",
            "url": "@[file://xWidget/assets/ic/${icon}.$[if::(eq::(${theme},dark),d,l)].uri]"
          },
          {
            "id": "nm1",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{ic.r}+5pt",
            "y": "12pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-37pt-{ic.w}-5pt-88pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${iname},${@i18n.pickItem})]",
            "fontSize": "13pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "nm2",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-37pt-88pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${iname},${@i18n.pickItem})]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(${hicon},1),1,0)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "lbl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "35pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.streak}",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1"
      },
      {
        "_note": "数字与单位的对齐(2026-09-07,与 intimacy v31 同一轮):StaticCanvas 的 txt 盒顶 = 该行字形 ink 顶(不是盒顶+字体 ascent),44pt 粗体数字基线在 y+31、12pt 汉字基线在 y+9.5 → 单位盒顶放 y+21.5(40pt 数字则 +20.5);老写法 82/80 是按 ascent 猜的,汉字比数字低 11pt。`••` 打码也是紧排会被顶到盒顶,故单独分支压到基线(y = 基线 − 11pt)。量法见 Numable-bundles/tools/rcnrender。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "13pt",
            "w": "-1",
            "h": "-1",
            "fontSize": "40pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "id": "num",
            "y": "52pt",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${streak},0)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "w": "-1",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.days}",
            "fontSize": "12pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "id": "unit",
            "x": "{num.r}+5pt",
            "y": "70.5pt"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "13pt",
            "w": "-1",
            "h": "-1",
            "fontSize": "40pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "id": "numM",
            "y": "70pt",
            "text": "••"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "w": "-1",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.days}",
            "fontSize": "12pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "id": "unitM",
            "x": "{numM.r}+5pt",
            "y": "70.5pt"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "30 天切成上下两条带而不是缩小格子（标准 §4.5 #5）：15 列时格子约 18pt，30 列挤在同一行只有 8pt，可读性差一个量级。上带 = 较早 15 天，下带 = 最近 15 天，左上到右下时间递增。",
        "id": "a0",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "110pt",
        "w": "(({parent.w}-25pt)/15-3pt)",
        "h": "(({parent.w}-25pt)/15-3pt)",
